WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.275
A strip of pine, thirty millimetres by three, standing on its edge.

2
00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:07.676
On its edge, it hardly sags at all.

3
00:00:08.328 --> 00:00:10.828
The same wood, ten times deeper.

4
00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:13.656
Depth counts three times over.
